{"surah":53,"ayahs":["وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">جْ</span>مِ إِذَا هَوَىٰ","مَا ضَلَّ صَاحِبُكُمْ وَمَا غَوَىٰ","وَمَا يَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نطِ</span>قُ عَنِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْهَوَىٰٓ","إِنْ هُوَ إِلَّا وَحْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">ىٌ يُ</span>وحَىٰ","عَلَّمَهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> شَدِيدُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقُوَىٰ","ذُو مِرَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ةٍ فَ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>سْتَوَىٰ","وَهُوَ بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأُفُقِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَعْلَىٰ","ثُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span> دَنَا فَتَدَلَّىٰ","فَكَانَ قَابَ قَوْسَيْنِ أَوْ أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>نَىٰ","فَأَوْحَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">ىٰٓ</span> إِلَىٰ عَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span>دِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">هِۦ</span> <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span> أَوْحَىٰ","مَا كَذَبَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْفُؤَادُ مَا رَأَىٰٓ","أَفَتُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">مَٰ</span>رُونَهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> عَلَىٰ مَا يَرَىٰ","وَلَقَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span> رَءَاهُ نَزْلَةً أُخْرَىٰ","عِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ندَ</span> سِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>رَةِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نتَ</span>هَىٰ","عِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ندَ</span>هَا جَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>ةُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَأْوَىٰٓ","إِذْ يَ